  "bodyHash": "ccc8c1d04d65c0ba",
  "content": "<h1><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408107/description_c8a0b12a-559b-4ce5-b57a-5d231f88aeff.png\" alt=\"Appleskin 套裝圖標\" width=\"170\" height=\"170\"></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想要將 Sapixcraft 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a> 一起使用嗎？</strong></h1>\n<p>如果默認<strong>金黃飽和度圖標</strong> 在 Sapixcraft 飢餓條旁顯得不協調，此修補程式即可解決這個問題。</p>\n<p>此資源套裝會將 AppleSkin 的飽和度圖標替換成符合 Sapixcraft 風格的版本，使所有內容完美匹配。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>您可以在<strong>三種樣式</strong>之間選擇：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>正常</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408107/description_7401393d-8ff8-4e22-b93b-4d278276cdf4.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>橙色</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408107/description_8231733b-b598-446b-afb7-3df6fd7bc2ad.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>漸層疲勞量表</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408107/description_49ab666b-f9f6-4792-9d39-554a7f4eeeea.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>載入順序：</strong>請將此套裝放在<strong>Sapixcraft</strong>上方。</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408107/description_db121dc8-fc7b-4aae-8fa8-31a939dccda0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>此套裝專為搭配使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sapixcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Sapixcraft</strong></a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AppleSkin</strong></a> 而設計。</p>",
